# src/*.css IS tracked (compiled from scss/ by `npm run build`, then
# committed) — see CLAUDE.md's "Build (SCSS)" section for why: Composer has
# no build-hook mechanism for installed dependencies, so the compiled CSS
# has to already exist in whatever Composer fetches. Always run
# `npm run build` and commit the result before tagging a release.
